OL,3,GNEWSALocals launch campaign to buy
OL,4,Aancient wood
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal villagers are hoping to buy an
OL,7,Fancient woodland so it can be saved
OL,8,Ffrom private sale and continue to be a
OL,9,Fsanctuary for generations to come.
OL,11,FLandowners Margaret and David Lloyd
OL,12,Fhave allowed the public to enjoy their
OL,13,F17-acre Ruscombe Wood near Stroud for
OL,14,Fthe last 20 years but have now decided
OL,15,Fto sell up.
OL,17,FKeen for it to go into the hands of
OL,18,Flocal residents, the couple have given
OL,19,FRuscombe Woodlands Committee one year
OL,20,Fto raise #164,000 to cover purchase,
OL,21,Flegal and survey costs.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
