OL,3,GNEWSALocals launch campaign to buy
OL,4,Aancient wood
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Humphreys from the committee
OL,7,Fsaid: "I like the idea that if we own
OL,8,Fthe woods, nature will become part of
OL,9,Fthe community and we can have that
OL,10,Finstead of a community hall."
